  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to toggle specific built-in bones from colliding, via an animation, and control them like I would any other PhysBone.\nI can do this if I disable them and put my own in place, but this means I may take a performance rank hit.\nThis could potentially be accomplished via: \n- allowing users to specify existing bones under the avatar controller to use for hand/head/etc bones.\n- an option to 'bake' these bones into our avatars (and increasing the performance rank limit accordingly)\n\n(not to say that's the only way or even the best way to handle it of course, just a couple of suggestions off the top of my head)",
